---
---

<section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-950 to-slate-900 text-white relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Content -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img
            src="/assets/clients/Zw3d_Logo_White.webp"
            alt="ZW3D CAD/CAM"
            class="h-8 w-auto object-contain"
          />
          <span class="badge-tag bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-400/30">
            ALL-IN-ONE 3D CAD/CAM
          </span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          Butuh Solusi 3D CAD &amp; Pemrograman Mesin CNC?
        </h2>

        <p class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
          <strong>ZW3D</strong> adalah software terintegrasi untuk <em>Product Design, Mold &amp; Die, serta 2–5 Axis CNC Machining</em>. Ditenagai oleh <strong>Overdrive™ Hybrid Modeling Engine</strong> yang mampu menggabungkan solid &amp; surface modeling tanpa batas.
        </p>

        <!-- Feature List -->
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span><strong>Multi-CAD Translator:</strong> Buka dan edit file CATIA, NX, SolidWorks, Creo, STEP, IGES langsung tanpa konversi pihak ketiga.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span><strong>Desain Cetakan (Mold &amp; Die):</strong> Pemisahan parting line, core &amp; cavity otomatis, dan pustaka komponen standar mold base lengkap.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span><strong>Integrated CAM Machining:</strong> Simulasi toolpath 2 hingga 5 sumbu dengan deteksi tabrakan presisi tinggi untuk mesin milling &amp; turning.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href="/zw3d"
            class="btn-accent text-sm py-3 px-6"
          >
            Pelajari Solusi ZW3D Lengkap
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6281912244662?text=Halo%20centralcad.id%20,%20aku%20mau%20informasi%20untuk%20ZWCAD%20dan%20pembelian%20lisensinya%20ya"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn-primary text-sm py-3 px-6"
          >
            Jadwalkan Demo Teknis
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Visual -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="cad-dark-card p-2 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl relative group">
          <img
            src="/assets/zwsoft/images/Architectural-Design-banner.png"
            alt="ZW3D Interface & Product Modeling"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded-xl group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-transparent to-transparent flex items-end p-6">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-400 tracking-wider uppercase">Hybrid Modeling</span>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Desain Part Kompleks &amp; Mold Industri Lebih Cepat</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
